    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      350.17,
      546.32,
      373.24
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Local Loans and Development Commissioners under Section 11 of the Local Loans andDevelopment Ordinance (Chapter 404) and approved by the Minister.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      386.17,
      546.11,
      433.24
    ],
    "text": "Local Loans and Development Commissioners.Colombo,16th March 2016.Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      446.17,
      546.09,
      481.24
    ],
    "text": "Local Loans and Development (Miscellaneous) Regulations No. 1 of 1995 published in Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 905/8 of January 10, 1996 as last amended by Regulation published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1771/22 ofAugust 16, 2012 is hereby further amended as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.57,
      488.17,
      546.09,
      511.24
    ],
    "text": "(1) In regulation 11, by the repeal of paragraph (2) thereof, and the substitution thereof, of the followingparagraph :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      127.17,
      518.17,
      541.21,
      541.24
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2) The Commissioners may grant loans upto a maximum of Eighty per cent (80%) of the estimatedcost of any project referred to in paragraph (2) of regulation 10 :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      139.77,
      548.17,
      546.25,
      571.24
    ],
    "text": "(a) Not exceeding Two million rupees, may be granted by the Commissioners on the recommendationof the Chairman ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      139.17,
      578.17,
      546.28,
      601.24
    ],
    "text": "(b) Exceeding Two million rupees but not exceeding Ten million rupees may be granted by theCommissioners ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      139.17,
      608.17,
      546.24,
      631.24
    ],
    "text": "(c) Exceeding Ten million rupees may be granted by the Commissioners, with the approval of theMinister-in-charge of the subject of the Local Loans and Development Fund has been assigned.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.57,
      644.17,
      546.24,
      667.24
    ],
    "text": "(2) In regulation 12, by the insertion immediately after the definition of the word \u201cCommissioners\u201d of the followingdefinition :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      680.17,
      545.46,
      691.24
    ],
    "text": "\u201cChairman\u201d means the Chairman of the Board of Commissioners appointed under Section 2 of the Ordinance",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
